@startuml
!include style.puml
title Acceptance Criteria Check (assigned developer)
autonumber
actor Developer
participant "Check panel\n(Client Component)" as UI
participant "POST .../acceptance-criteria-check" as R
participant "CompletionAssessmentService" as S
participant "TaskSnapshotService" as SN
participant "GitHubEvidenceService" as GE
participant "CompletionAssessmentRepository" as CR
participant "LlmGateway" as GW

Developer -> UI : Run check
UI -> R : {} (same-origin JSON)
R -> R : validate Origin, Content-Type,\nUUIDs, body == {}; session -> 401
R -> S : runCheck(project, task, verified identity)
S -> SN : getAssignedSnapshot()\n(one SQL statement: criteria, SHAs, repo)
SN --> S : snapshot (or 403 / 404)
S -> GE : loadPathRules() at default-branch tip
S -> GE : isAncestor() -> unique anchor SHA
S -> CR : findReusable(task, commit-set hash,\ncriteria hash, path-rules hash)
alt cache hit
  S -> GW : recordCacheHit()  (no quota, no rate)
  S --> R : {check, reused: true}
else cache miss
  S -> GE : fetchDiff() for each SHA
  S -> S : redact secrets; drop lockfiles, generated,\nbinary files; whole-file selection by priority\nwithin 48,000 chars; list omitted files
  S -> GW : run(instructions, segments,\nmaxOutputTokens 2000, validator)
  GW --> S : validated per-criterion statuses + references
  S -> S : resolve L<n> references to\nverified excerpts; downgrade\nunverifiable "addressed" to unclear
  S -> CR : save(result, model, redacted)
  S --> R : {check, reused: false}
end
R --> UI : 200 (Cache-Control: no-store)
note over S, GW
  No database transaction is open during
  GitHub or LLM calls. The check never
  changes task state.
end note
@enduml
